tools.description:
Schedule a fetch job. It runs once immediately and the result is returned. Job spec: {"series": name, "cron": "m h dom mon dow" (UTC, at most every 5 min),
"request": {"url", "method"?: "GET"|"POST", "headers"?: {}, "body"?: obj|str,
            "pages"?: {"param": "page", "start"?: 0, "max"?: 1-10}
